  "Web viewer": "網頁版檢視器",
  ": draw a netlist as a schematic": "：將網表繪製為原理圖",
  "Source files:": "原始檔：",
  "A file of 0.4 uses no package unless its header record names it. <code>rnl-std-all</code> is the one collection of the series: it brings in the sub-packages that give elements their symbols and objects their styles, define the circuit structures, and fill in grounds, supplies and net labels for unwired pins. A file may name the sub-packages one by one instead, and add packages that are used on demand, such as <code>rnl-std-45deg</code> for 45-degree symbols. (In the series 0.3 and 0.2, <code>rnl-std</code> is at the root of every netlist by default.) This page lists every package with what it is for, what it references and the text that defines it; the symbols are drawn by the RNL core when the site is built, as the viewers draw them.": "0.4 版檔案除非在檔頭記錄中寫明，否則不會使用任何套件。<code>rnl-std-all</code> 是該系列唯一的套件集合：它匯入多個子套件，分別為實例指定符號、為物件設定樣式、定義電路結構，並為未連線的接腳補上接地、電源與網路標籤。檔案也可以改為逐一寫明子套件，並依需求加入其他套件（例如用於 45 度符號的 <code>rnl-std-45deg</code>）。（在 0.3 與 0.2 系列中，每份網表的根層級預設皆使用 <code>rnl-std</code>。）本頁列出每個套件的用途、引用關係與定義原文；所有符號皆於網站建置時由 RNL 核心繪製，與檢視器中呈現的結果完全一致。",
  "Series 0.4": "系列 0.4"
}
